#
# The C6 keeps the stock ESP-IDF 2nd-stage bootloader (already flashed on the
# module, reads otadata and boots ota_0/ota_1). MCUboot is intentionally not
# used so hosted OTA stays wire-compatible with the P4 c6_ota tool.

choice BOOTLOADER
	default BOOTLOADER_NONE
endchoice
